# Prettier reads .gitignore as well; these are the tracked files it leaves alone.
# Build output and release staging.
dist/
release-artifacts/
# Vendored snapshots: their producers format them, and a checksum pins each file.
vendor/
# npm writes the lockfile, and `make knip-baseline` writes the Knip baseline.
package-lock.json
.knip-baseline.json
# Markdown: Prettier pads every table column to its widest cell, so one new row
# rewrites the whole table; the README's examples are wrapped for reading, not
# at the code's line width; and CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md is the Contributor Covenant
# text as published.
*.md
